# =============================================================================
# Template for the PocoS3 additive patch against upstream RPCS3.
#
# This file is NOT a runnable patch yet; it documents the shape of the
# patch that needs to be generated against third_party/rpcs3.
#
# To turn this template into a real patch:
#
#   1. cd third_party/rpcs3
#   2. Apply the modifications described in the function-by-function
#      section below to rpcs3/main.cpp, rpcs3/Emu/System.{cpp,h},
#      and rpcs3/CMakeLists.txt.
#   3. From the repo root:
#        cd third_party/rpcs3
#        git diff > ../patches/pocos3-android-entry-points.patch
#        cd ../..
#   4. Verify:
#        ./patches/apply.sh third_party/rpcs3
#   5. Update VERSION with the SHA you rebased against.
#
# Once generated, replace this file's contents with the real patch and
# remove the template marker from the filename (rename to .patch).
# =============================================================================

# --- BEGIN TEMPLATE ---

